      "file": "dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-session-controller/lib/index.js",
      "contains": ["workspacePathApplications", "openWorkspacePath", "canOpenWorkspacePath", "workspaceDesktop"],
      "why": "0.2.1 起客户端拿不到 remote.session，改由本插件宿主半侧（index.js）代调这几个宿主方法。它们一旦改名/删除，「在应用中打开」整组动作就会失效——这正是 0.2.0→0.2.1 升级时真实发生过的破坏。"
    },
    {
      "id": "host-webserver-contract",
      "file": "dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-host-webserver/lib/index.js",
      "contains": ["register(route)", "route.handler(req, res)", "kind === \"exact\""],
      "why": "宿主半侧的 /ctx-menu/* 路由依赖 webServer.register({kind,path,handler}) 以及「handler(req,res) 两参数、query 自己解析」的契约。"
    },
    {
      "id": "menu-primitives-exports",
      "filePrefix": "dsh/node_modules/@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-frontend/dist/assets/index-",
      "contains": ["MenuItemButton", "MenuSurface", "fileMention"],
